I recently completed my research internship at <strong>Honda Research Institute USA (Honda-RI)</strong>.

I worked on autonomous-driving dataset curation and an end-to-end data pipeline covering raw-data processing, annotation and correction, and benchmarking.

I am especially grateful to my manager, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jovindsa/">Jovin D'sa</a>, for his mentorship, thoughtful feedback, and continued support throughout the internship. His guidance helped me navigate technical challenges and refine my approach to research and data engineering. I also sincerely thank my colleagues at Honda-RI for sharing their expertise and creating such a collaborative and welcoming environment.

